  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the threatening confrontation scene",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the scene of the elderly woman holding a gun and the accompanying text, which collectively create a confrontational and threatening atmosphere. The text 'you look at my woman step off johnny law' directly addresses the viewer ('you'), implying the user is the one being warned or threatened. This creates a direct semiotic projection where the user is positioned as the target of the threat, making them an active participant in the meme's narrative. The projection is onto the scene (threatening_confrontation) which includes both the visual material (elderly_woman) and textual material (text_chunk_1) that together form the hostile context.",
